/*
 * Southern defense tower machine room —
 * west of stower1.
 *
 * Strategy A FluffOS room. Original
 * (PushHandle / PullHandle / SearchCmd /
 * MoveChain, Check* nightday, east
 * stower1, south stower4) is
 * stower2_ldmud.lpc. Look-ats only:
 * pull / push / search / raise/lower
 * chain are not loaded. Frozen:
 * rHandle=1 (Lower), rMachine=0, rChain=0
 * (lowered). CheckOpening day falls
 * through the missing break into default
 * (both sentences). Archive keeps “an
 * high tower”, “it's other side”, “They
 * seems”, “an wooden handle”, “doesn'
 * smell”, “Thereis also”, “it's way”.
 * East stower1 is loaded; south stower4
 * is not.
 */

